     '## Design and tuning (dev/val of set A; the judged dev/val subset)', '',
     f"Rules (flag if either fires): the Part C number checker (score < 1), or an extractor v5 mismatch between the candidate's extracted facts and the reference facts, in one of two modes fixed on dev/val: **conflict** (a field present in both differs) or **conflict + omission** (also a reference fact the extraction lacks). Candidates not flagged by the rules go to the frozen holistic Gemma-2-9B judge (prompt_v2, Step 7 / 12 / 39) and are flagged if its score is at or below a threshold. Both the mode and the threshold were chosen on the dev/val pairs ({R['pairs']['devval']} judged: 281 harmless, 120 twins) so that at most 5.6% of harmless reports are flagged. "
